        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-14T23:19:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The key size validation is broken, as this allows e.g. 64 bytes for AES-CBC.  AES-512 does not exist :-)  I think it would be easiest to just whitelist the allowed sizes for each algorithm.  AES-XTS allows 32, 48, 64; the others allow 16 and 32.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 92,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 119,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "47f21f1bf010b47f228ca4d8925bce4290dcf0c4",
