        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-14T23:19:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Don\u0027t you need to pass in the key size that matches the capability?  For that matter, why is the key size passed in here at all when a capability with that key size was already selected?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 134,
        "startChar": 5,
